---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Nossa História | ContábilPro - Tradição e Inovação"
    description="Conheça a equipe de especialistas por trás da ContábilPro e nossa missão de transformar a contabilidade em uma ferramenta de gestão estratégica."
    currentPage="sobre"
    ogImage="/assets/img/image_21.jpg"
>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section data-aos="fade-up" class="relative py-20 px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto overflow-hidden pt-24">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="z-10">
                <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 mb-6 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-fixed-variant text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide">NOSSA ESSÊNCIA</span>
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-bold leading-tight mb-8 text-on-primary-fixed">Nossa História, Seu Sucesso</h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-10">
                    Mais do que números, construímos alicerces financeiros para transformar a visão dos empreendedores brasileiros em realidades sustentáveis e prósperas.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-surface-container-high shadow-xl">
                    <img src="/assets/img/image_21.jpg"
                         alt="Equipe da ContábilPro reunida em escritório moderno e iluminado"
                         class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[20%]"
                         width="600" height="450"
                         loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
                </div>
                <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 p-8 bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-lg max-w-xs">
                    <p class="text-primary font-headline italic text-2xl mb-1">Fundada em 2010</p>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Uma trajetória pautada pela excelência e confiança mútua.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Timeline Section -->
    <section data-aos="fade-up" class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-20">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">A Evolução da Excelência</h2>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-primary mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0.5 h-full bg-outline-variant opacity-30 hidden md:block"></div>
                <div class="space-y-24">
                    <!-- 2010 -->
                    <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 text-center md:text-right md:pr-12 mb-8 md:mb-0">
                            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">2010</h3>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic font-headline text-lg">A Fundação</p>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Nascimento da ContábilPro com o objetivo de democratizar a gestão contábil de alta performance para pequenas empresas.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-surface-container-lowest z-10"></div>
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12"></div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 2015 -->
                    <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 order-2 md:order-1"></div>
                        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-surface-container-lowest z-10"></div>
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 text-center md:text-left md:pl-12 order-1 md:order-2 mb-8 md:mb-0">
                            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">2015</h3>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic font-headline text-lg">Digitalização Total</p>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Implementação de processos 100% digitais, eliminando o papel e trazendo agilidade sem precedentes aos clientes.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 2020 -->
                    <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 text-center md:text-right md:pr-12 mb-8 md:mb-0">
                            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">2020</h3>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic font-headline text-lg">Expansão Consultiva</p>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Lançamento do braço de consultoria estratégica voltado para PMEs em momentos de crise e crescimento acelerado.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-surface-container-lowest z-10"></div>
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12"></div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 2024 -->
                    <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between">
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 order-2 md:order-1"></div>
                        <div class="hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-4 h-4 bg-primary rounded-full border-4 border-surface-container-lowest z-10"></div>
                        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 text-center md:text-left md:pl-12 order-1 md:order-2 mb-8 md:mb-0">
                            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">2024</h3>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant italic font-headline text-lg">Inteligência Estratégica</p>
                            <p class="text-on-surface-variant mt-2">Integração de IA para análise preditiva fiscal, consolidando a liderança em inovação contábil no país.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Values Section -->
    <section data-aos="fade-up" class="py-24 px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-12">Nossos Pilares</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-6" aria-hidden="true">balance</span>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Ética</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Conformidade rigorosa e conduta moral irrepreensível em cada detalhe.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-6" aria-hidden="true">visibility</span>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Transparência</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Informação clara e acessível, fortalecendo a relação de confiança absoluta.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-6" aria-hidden="true">lightbulb</span>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Inovação</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Busca constante por tecnologias que simplificam a vida do empresário.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-6" aria-hidden="true">hub</span>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Foco no Cliente</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Soluções personalizadas que respeitam a identidade de cada negócio.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Team Grid -->
    <section data-aos="fade-up" class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low px-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-16 gap-6">
                <div class="max-w-2xl">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Especialistas a seu Serviço</h2>
                    <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Unimos décadas de experiência multisetorial para oferecer uma visão holística das suas finanças.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                <div class="group">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-surface-container-highest">
                        <img src="/assets/img/image_22.jpg"
                             alt="Dra. Helena Souza — CEO e fundadora da ContábilPro"
                             class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"
                             width="400" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Dra. Helena Souza</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-primary font-medium mb-1">CEO & Founder (CRC/RJ-123456)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="group">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-surface-container-highest">
                        <img src="/assets/img/image_23.jpg"
                             alt="Dr. Ricardo Mendes — Diretor Fiscal da ContábilPro"
                             class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"
                             width="400" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Dr. Ricardo Mendes</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-primary font-medium mb-1">Diretor Fiscal</p>
                </div>
                <div class="group">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-surface-container-highest">
                        <img src="/assets/img/image_24.jpg"
                             alt="Sra. Ana Paula — Consultora PME na ContábilPro"
                             class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"
                             width="400" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Sra. Ana Paula</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-primary font-medium mb-1">Consultora PME</p>
                </div>
                <div class="group">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-surface-container-highest">
                        <img src="/assets/img/image_25.jpg"
                             alt="Sr. Carlos Alberto — Gestão de Departamento Pessoal na ContábilPro"
                             class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110"
                             width="400" height="500" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Sr. Carlos Alberto</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-primary font-medium mb-1">Gestão de DP</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Certifications -->
    <section data-aos="fade-up" class="py-16 bg-surface-container-lowest px-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-12 opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-outline" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">ISO 9001</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-outline" aria-hidden="true">gavel</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">CRC-RJ</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-outline" aria-hidden="true">policy</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">OAB Contábil</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section data-aos="fade-up" class="py-24 px-8">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-primary-container rounded-3xl p-12 md:p-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-white/5 rounded-full -mr-32 -mt-32"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-32 h-32 bg-white/5 rounded-full -ml-16 -mb-16"></div>
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-8 relative z-10 font-headline italic">Pronto para elevar o patamar do seu negócio?</h2>
            <p class="text-blue-100 text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto relative z-10">Agende agora uma conversa com nossos diretores e descubra como a ContábilPro pode acelerar seus resultados.</p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center relative z-10">
                <a href="/contato" class="bg-white text-primary px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all active:scale-95 inline-block">
                    Conheça nossos especialistas
                </a>
                <a href="https://wa.me/5521933445566"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="border border-white/30 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all inline-block">
                    Falar pelo WhatsApp
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
